# REQUIRES: verilator
# Paged register state: with --page p a copy of several instances keeps its
# registers in a page RAM and moves an instance's state in and out p host
# cycles at a time (a fetch buffer filled a page a host cycle before the
# state pass, a write-back buffer written a page a host cycle after it). The
# leaves (Driver/Inputs/paged) page a 160-bit register cut across pages and
# 72-bit RAM columns (--region-bits 72), a 13-bit sum and a byte, and keep the register their ready pass reads; their
# RAM is read through a register. Against the target (tb_late.sv, and
# tb_vmem.sv with the RAM virtual), from zero state: one copy at p = 1, two
# copies chained in a host cycle at p = 2, overlapped frames at p = 3 (a dense
# page word, --no-page-masks; elsewhere byte write masks by enable), nested
# sequencers with a short lead at p = 4, ready passes by rank with
# interleaved copies, and virtual memories at p = 2, 3, 4 (with bubbles,
# copies, a short lead); bubbles and stalled channels throughout.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/paged
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/one --static --bubbles --page 1 Leaf > %t/one.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ONE < %t/one.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/one/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/one/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/one/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/one/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/chain --static --bubbles --page 2 --region-bits 72 --copies Leaf:2 --zero-latency-links --zero-latency-chains Leaf > %t/chain.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=CHAIN < %t/chain.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/chain/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/chain/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/chain/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/chain/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +bubble=40 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/mod --static --bubbles --modulo --page 3 --no-page-masks Leaf > %t/mod.log 2>&1
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/mod/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/mod/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/mod/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/mod/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
